  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "SharpVision 1.5.0-beta.1 prerelease: a broad correctness-hardening pass across controls (activation-handler resilience for bound commands, appearance-change comparisons, navigation and focus), runtime and hosting (dispatcher timer generation scoping, stopping-token cancellation guarantees, out-of-band render flush gating during shutdown), styling (theme attribute-name resolution), and grapheme/text classification, alongside further work on the Document control's naming, visibility, and selection foundation (TextSelectionMap/TextSelectionGlyph/TextSelectionSource). See https://github.com/pavkam/sharp-vision/blob/main/docs/index.md for API contracts, examples, and current support.",
